#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Security/Introducing-ros2-security.rst:20
msgid ""
"Security helps protect ROS communication by using DDS-Security features for "
"authentication and encryption. This article shows how to set up ``sros2``, "
"create security files, and run a secured talker and listener demo. After you "
"follow these steps, you can run nodes and command-line tools in a secured "
"ROS network."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Security/Introducing-ros2-security.rst:28
msgid "**Goal:** Set up security with ``sros2``."
msgstr ""

